msgid " • <style=\"KKeyword\">Morale</style>: \n\t + {0} of duplicant's Piloting skill as morale (up to +10)\n    After \"Cosmic Archaeology\" completion: \n\t additional +1 for each unique artifact (up to +5) \n\t additional +1 for each 2 more unique artifacts (up to +5)\n\t additional +1 for each 3 more unique artifacts (up to +5)"
msgstr " • <style=\"KKeyword\">士气</style>：\n\t 按复制人驾驶技能的 {0} 给予士气（最高 +10）\n    完成「宇宙考古」后：\n\t 每件独特文物额外 +1（最高 +5）\n\t 之后每 2 件独特文物额外 +1（最高 +5）\n\t 之后每 3 件独特文物额外 +1（最高 +5）"

